<title>UK: Zeneca to invest 17 mln stg in Amistar.</title>
<headline>Zeneca to invest 17 mln stg in Amistar.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zeneca Group Plc said on Monday it was to invest a further 17 million stg in support of its new agricultural fungicide Amistar.</p>
<p>In a statement, Zeneca Agrochemicals said it planned to build a formulation and packaging operation at its manufacturing site at Grangemouth in Scotland.</p>
<p>Zeneca has already invested 22 million stg in a plant at the site to make the key active ingredient in Amistar, which the company expects to become one of its top-selling products.</p>
</text>
